+## Sales (schema 3)
+
+Schema 2 upgrades by adding an empty `sales` collection and `seq.sale`. Each
+sales row has an id, ticket, soldAt (UTC instant), dishId, qty (whole portions),
+and a snapshot of scaled ingredients. Snapshots keep theoretical use stable
+when recipes change. Tickets already present before an import are skipped;
+all rows of a new ticket in one file are imported together. Imports are atomic.
